From: AEON-7 <aeon-7@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 19:43:50 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 07/12] [AEON M2] inkling2 gfx12: decode MoE (fused router +
 per-expert GEMV) for T<=16

Original AEON work. Router logits kernel (bf16 weight, fp32 accumulate,
resets the routing scratch), top-k kernel with atomic per-expert buckets,
block-factored NVFP4/MXFP8 expert GEMVs (SwiGLU fused into the w13 pass)
and a slot-ordered combine. AEON_MOE_EXACT=1 rounds each dequantized
weight to bf16 like the reference (slower).
---
 vllm/models/inkling2/amd/moe_gfx12.py      |  19 ++
 vllm/models/inkling2/amd/ops/moe_decode.py | 353 +++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 372 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 vllm/models/inkling2/amd/ops/moe_decode.py

